WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.200
Illustrative concept: a focused business website with a clear next step.

00:03.200 --> 00:06.400
An AI enquiry assistant can help prepare a request for human review.

00:06.400 --> 00:09.600
Bookings connect to a calendar with confirmation by email.

00:09.600 --> 00:12.800
An owner dashboard brings customer requests and next actions together.

00:12.800 --> 00:16.000
EmberWeb: websites, apps and useful AI. Scope agreed before payment.
